   "description": "<p>Legendary guitarist John Scofield’s clawing electric guitar sound is immediately recognizable, and he’s given to spiking an extended funk jam with wet, rock-ish riffs — but he swings with the baddest of them. He got his first big break with the unenviable task of replacing Pat Metheny in Gary Burton&#8217;s quartet in the late 70s and joined Miles Davis shortly thereafter for three of the Prince of Darkness&#8217; 80s albums. He&#8217;s since led a remarkable career flitting in between more traditional bop, groove, funk, electric bands and all other kinds of names.</p>\n<p>Here he leads his <em>Electrospective </em>project, which focuses more on those parts of his catalog best plied to extended funk jams.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>**This show is SOLD OUT**</p>\n",
   "ticket_link": {
    "title": "",
    "url": "https://wl.eventim.us/event/john-scofields-electrospective/685362?afflky=TheHamiltonDC",
    "target": "_blank"
   },
   "price": "$75-117",
